<title>USA: Silver CSD 1, N.M., won by Griffin, Kubik.</title>
<headline>Silver CSD 1, N.M., won by Griffin, Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin, Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc said it won $4.75 million of Silver Consolidated School District No 1, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.16 percent.</p>
</text>
